      "text": "🌍 Top 10 Most Dangerous Airports in the World ✈️🔥\n\n1️⃣ 🇳🇵 Lukla, Nepal – Short runway in the Himalayas with tricky weather.  \n2️⃣ 🇬🇮 Gibraltar – Runway crosses a busy road!  \n3️⃣ 🇯🇲 Norman Manley, Jamaica – Runway ends at the ocean.  \n4️⃣ 🇳🇿 Queenstown, NZ – Mountainous terrain and strong winds.  \n5️⃣ 🇵🇰 Paro, Bhutan – Only expert pilots can land here.  \n6️⃣ 🇬🇷 Santorini, Greece – Narrow runway and strong winds.  \n7️⃣ 🇲🇨 Gibraltar – Very short runway next to city traffic.  \n8️⃣ 🇧🇷 Nóbrega, Brazil – Tight turns and forest surroundings.  \n9️⃣ 🇲🇹 Malta – Sudden strong winds.  \n🔟 🇵🇭 Mactan-Cebu, Philippines – Storm-prone with tricky winds.\n\n✈️ Which one would you dare to land at? Stay tuned for more! 🌍 @globalstatsx",
